<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59732" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾰτιστ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be mightiest, best, most excellent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κρατιστεύων λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					180
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ κρατιστεύων κατ᾽
			ὄμμα</span>, of the Sun, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				102
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ.</span>
			<i>the conqueror</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ
			ἡττηθείς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				614a4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.2.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be superior</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σώματι καὶ τῇ ψυχῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.4.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.6.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἆλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.5.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. gen. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					3.18
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἡλικιωτῶν κ. ἐν τοῖς ἀγῶσι</span>
			<i>to be first of</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				9.22
			</span></i>.</div>
